<title>SINGAPORE: Asia Fuel Oil - Singapore markets closed.</title>
<headline>Asia Fuel Oil - Singapore markets closed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore physical oil products market is closed on Friday for the Good Friday holiday. The market will reopen on Monday, March 31.</p>
<p>This is how the fuel oil market ended on Thursday;</p>
<p>(Prices in dollars per tonne, unless stated)</p>
<p>MTH  FOB SIN		     BUY/SELL	 PREV BUY/SELL</p>
<p> FEB  LSWR *		    17.20/17.50	   17.20/17.50</p>
<p> MAR  FUEL OIL (180 CST)   100.00/102.00	 100.00/102.00</p>
<p> MAR  FUEL OIL (380 CST)    94.00/96.00	   94.00/96.00</p>
<p> APR  FUEL OIL SWAPS	  99.00/99.75	   98.50/99.00</p>
<p> MAY  FUEL OIL SWAPS	  98.00/98.75	   97.50/98.25</p>
<p>*Dollars per barrel</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3080)</p>
</text>
